<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">smelt-iron-ore</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

Iron ore from caves and mountain scree, driven out of the rock in the
forge fire. Two lumps of ore make one rough iron ingot.

